  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x200b;&#x200b;Provision of Emergency Shelter and Non-Food Items (NFIs) for Populations Affected by Drought and the Northern Ethiopian Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this intervention, IOM and its operational partners are supporting households through provision of either lifesaving in-kind emergency shelter, in-kind non-food items (NFI), cash for NFI and/or provision of shelter repair kits in Amhara, Afar, Oromia, Somali and Tigray regions in Ethiopia. The overall objective of the project is to restore dignified living conditions and access to essential household items for internally displaced persons and returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
